  _pages:
  - Image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 038bf06b92c1e8f44a68e2b1e78b45a8, type: 3}
    Video: {fileID: 0}
    Title: Yantra
    Body: 'Yantras are sacred talismans that hold power over spirits.

      With your gun holstered, hold {RMB} to open the Yantra wheel.

      Move the mouse to choose a Yantra, then release {RMB} to select it.'
  - Image: {fileID: 0}
    Video: {fileID: 32900000, guid: c9543ddf6ef1f1c4e9dd71ccab4f13f5, type: 3}
    Title: Drawing a Yantra
    Body: 'Once selected, the Yantra''s pattern appears on screen.

      Hold {LMB} and trace the pattern to draw it.

      When the drawing is complete, press {LMB} again to unleash its power.'
